Origin: EmberBSD ACPI fan telemetry correction.

Report unavailable RPM without reading an unqualified tachometer value.
The fan-handoff diff owns the initial PWM state.

diff --git a/Silicon/RaspberryPi/RpiSiliconPkg/Include/Rp1.asi b/Silicon/RaspberryPi/RpiSiliconPkg/Include/Rp1.asi
--- a/Silicon/RaspberryPi/RpiSiliconPkg/Include/Rp1.asi
+++ b/Silicon/RaspberryPi/RpiSiliconPkg/Include/Rp1.asi
@@ -168,2 +167,0 @@
-  Offset (0x3C),
-  FRPM, 32,
@@ -227 +225 @@
-  Local1 = FRPM
+  Local1 = 0xFFFFFFFF // Fan speed is unavailable, as specified by ACPI.
